ed after the patch, sized by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example."}],"role":"collection","type":"topic"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView/toolbarVisibility(_:for:)":{"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"toolbarVisibility","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI10VisibilityO","text":"Visibility","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"for","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI16ToolbarPlacementV","text":"ToolbarPlacement","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"...) -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI4ViewP","text":"View","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView\/toolbarVisibility(_:for:)","abstract":[],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview\/toolbarvisibility(_:for:)","kind":"symbol","title":"toolbarVisibility(_:for:)"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Drags a layer in any direction with momentum and rubber-band bounds. The draggable"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"card responds to touch input via Origami’s "},{"code":"origami.Drag","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" patch, which wires its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"output "},{"code":"Position","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" to the layer’s transform. When released near the center, the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"card snaps back to its resting position."}],"url":"\/documentation\/swami\/int